      ],
      "image": "assets/images/91737/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat sweetened condensed milk and peanut butter in a heavy saucepan over medium heat, stirring constantly, until just bubbly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YOjWJbt7BzCmoZudn9o0b3hIXqM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/91737-eagle-brand-peanut-butter-fudge-step-01-6aabbb83d4134a83bca63c3e47ebd502.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/91737/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from heat. Stir in white chocolate until smooth. Immediately stir in peanuts and vanilla.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HI4KYc3p_rRGXdeACffZcJo2afM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/91737-eagle-brand-peanut-butter-fudge-step-03-a8643c8297ae4236bf9d387a330a000c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/91737/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread evenly into wax paper lined 8-or 9-inch square pan. Cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/G_hNLrxD5yiyC18g0LhQk7AA5zE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/91737-eagle-brand-peanut-butter-fudge-step-04-683863dc33b2471e8b6b847fff60aa08.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/91737/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and chill for 2 hours or until firm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn fudge onto a cutting board; peel off paper. Cut into squares. Store leftovers covered in refrigerator.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
